#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_modal_analysis.ipynb:10002
#: 2e7df26a82cf4d14bb5c7fafb1d67ce2
msgid "High-Precision Modal Analysis of Suspension Systems"
msgstr "懸架系の高精度モーダル解析"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_modal_analysis.ipynb:10004
#: ef4b871dc1c348c49d5cbc656892dbf8
msgid ""
"**Operational Modal Analysis (OMA)** extracts resonance frequencies, damping"
" ratios, and mode shapes from measured vibration data without requiring a "
"known excitation force.  This is the standard approach for identifying the "
"mechanical eigenmodes of KAGRA's suspension systems (TypeA, TypeB, TypeBp) "
"using ambient motion or swept-sine measurements."
msgstr ""
"**運用モーダル解析（OMA: Operational Modal Analysis）** は、既知の "
"励振力なしに振動データから共振周波数、減衰比、モード形状を抽出する手法です。 KAGRA "
"の懸架系（TypeA、TypeB、TypeBp）の固有振動モード同定に使われています。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_modal_analysis.ipynb:10010
#: b83ec0cd8c454909b511f910e060ac15
msgid "**What this tutorial covers:**"
msgstr "**このチュートリアルで学ぶこと：**"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_modal_analysis.ipynb:10011
#: f6a25087338d40b2b5e087da04299273
msgid ""
"Generating a synthetic multi-DOF Frequency Response Function (FRF) matrix"
msgstr "多自由度 FRF（周波数応答関数）行列の合成"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_modal_analysis.ipynb:10012
#: 31748f35c8fa46e6a5c6a70324c2fffc
msgid ""
"Running OMA with **pyOMA** (falls back to analytic extraction when "
"unavailable)"
msgstr "**pyOMA** を使った OMA 実行（未インストール時は解析的フォールバック）"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_modal_analysis.ipynb:10013
#: 29c07105ebf14b30aa8380b7a97adec8
msgid ""
"Converting pyOMA results to gwexpy with "
"`FrequencySeries.from_pyoma_results()`"
msgstr "`FrequencySeries.from_pyoma_results()` で gwexpy に変換する"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_modal_analysis.ipynb:10014
#: c39aa009bd914a53b8cdcf16a324d7d8
msgid "Visualising mode shapes, damping vs. frequency, and FRF reconstruction"
msgstr "モード形状・減衰比の可視化と FRF 再構成"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_modal_analysis.ipynb:10016
#: 984024330932443585371a92a6bc7bf6
msgid ""
"**Note**: This notebook is self-contained; all cells run without pyOMA. "
"Install it with `pip install pyOMA` for real OMA analysis."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_modal_analysis.ipynb:10019
#: 48f735d4baaf448499938e41b169f02c
msgid ""
"**Relation to `case_violin_mode.ipynb`**: The violin-mode tutorial focuses "
"on a single channel and spectral peak fitting.  This tutorial handles "
"**multi-channel FRF matrices** and full **mode-shape extraction** — the "
"foundation for actuation matrix calibration and active modal damping."
msgstr ""
"**`case_violin_mode.ipynb` との違い：** バイオリンモードチュートリアルは "
"単一チャネルのスペクトルピークフィッティングに特化しています。 本チュートリアルは**多チャネル FRF 行列**と**完全なモード形状抽出**を扱い、"
" 作動行列較正（MODAL2COIL マトリクス）や能動制振フィルタ設計の基礎になります。"

#: ../../how-to/control/advanced_modal_analysis.ipynb:20002
